  "summary": "Each rate is one GPU in the cheapest configuration QuantaCloud lists for that card, with that configuration's own region. The catalogue prices the same card at several node sizes and host sizes and the per-GPU rate differs between them; the figure here is the single card a reader can launch. Compute is metered by the second. Reserved and dedicated capacity is quoted, not listed, so no committed rate is read.",
